@startuml
' Sequence flow (PlantUML sequence diagram) — temporal view of one event
' moving from an Azure AKS microservice through a Microsoft Fabric data
' plane to a Power BI consumer. Companion to 03-system-architecture.puml
' (same icon set, different lens: time on the vertical axis).
'
' Source: https://github.com/hanv89/archicon
' License: MIT (this diagram); see repo LICENSE.
' Icons:
'   Microsoft Azure architecture icons via Azure-PlantUML upstream (MIT) —
'     subject to Microsoft's Azure Architecture Icons ToU + Trademark
'     Guidelines; see repo NOTICE.
'   Microsoft Fabric icons via @fabric-msft/svg-icons npm (MIT, published
'     by Microsoft Corporation) — subject to Microsoft Fabric icon ToU
'     + Trademark Guidelines; see repo NOTICE.
'
' Render: paste this file's content into
'   https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/uml/

title Event ingestion sequence — AKS → Fabric → Power BI

actor "Data analyst" as analyst

participant "<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Azure/Containers/AzureKubernetesService.png>\n**AKS microservice**" as aks
participant "<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Azure/Integration/AzureServiceBus.png>\n**Service Bus**" as sb
participant "<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Fabric/png/eventstream_40_item.png>\n**Eventstream**" as estream
participant "<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Fabric/png/lakehouse_40_item.png>\n**Lakehouse**" as lake
participant "<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Fabric/png/data_engineering_48_color.png>\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Fabric/png/notebook_40_item.png>\n**Data Engineering**\nSpark notebook" as nb
participant "<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Fabric/png/data_warehouse_40_item.png>\n**Data Warehouse**" as wh
participant "<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Fabric/png/semantic_model_40_item.png>\n**Semantic Model**" as sem
participant "<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Fabric/png/power_bi_48_color.png>\n<img:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hanv89/archicon/main/dist/Fabric/png/report_40_item.png>\n**Power BI**\nReport" as pbi

== Ingest ==
aks -> sb : publish OrderCreated event\n(AMQP)
sb -> estream : route via SB destination
estream -> lake : land event as Delta\n(bronze table)

== Transform ==
lake -> nb : trigger notebook\n(scheduled / event-driven)
nb -> nb : cleanse + enrich\n(Spark)
nb -> lake : write silver + gold\nDelta tables
lake -> wh : load gold dim/fact\n(T-SQL COPY INTO)

== Curate ==
wh -> sem : refresh semantic model\n(DirectQuery / Import)

== Consume ==
analyst -> pbi : open report
pbi -> sem : DAX query
sem --> pbi : aggregated result
pbi --> analyst : rendered dashboard

@enduml
